@startuml system-context
!include style.iuml
title JudgeLab v0.1: system context

actor Developer
rectangle "JudgeLab\n(judgelab CLI)" as JL
cloud "Target model\n(OpenAI-compatible or Anthropic API)" as Target
cloud "Judge model\n(OpenAI-compatible or Anthropic API)" as Judge
file "Evaluation config\n(YAML)" as Config
file "Benchmark\n(JSON)" as Bench
file "Report\n(JSON)" as Report
collections "Environment variables\n(API keys)" as Env

Developer --> JL : judgelab run --config
JL --> Config : reads
JL --> Bench : reads
JL --> Env : reads key by name
JL --> Target : asks each question
JL --> Judge : asks for a verdict
JL --> Report : writes
Developer ..> Report : reviews
@enduml
